OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FVariable
OL,6,Fcloud in the east with the odd coastal
OL,7,Fshower possible. Otherwise dry with
OL,8,Fclear spells allowing fog to form
OL,9,Fagain overnight and perhaps the odd
OL,10,Ftouch of rural frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FAgain fog may be quite slow to
OL,13,Fclear in the morning. Otherwise a dry
OL,14,Fday with variable cloud and bright or
OL,15,Fsunny spells.
