OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart Tuesday, cloudier later with
OL,7,Fsome outbreaks of rain and freshening
OL,8,Fwinds, this gradually clearing through
OL,9,FWednesday. Dry but cooler on Thursday
OL,10,Fwith variable cloud and bright spells.
